---
layout: layouts/base.njk
permalink: /contact/index.html
pageType: contact
title: Contact Realjet | Precast Concrete Lines & Machinery
seoTitle: Contact Realjet | Precast Concrete Lines & Machinery
description: Contact Realjet about custom machinery component manufacturing or project-specific production lines for precast concrete components.
canonical: https://realjetech.com/contact/
robots: index, follow
---
<header class="contact-hero">
  <div class="container">
    <nav class="breadcrumbs" aria-label="Breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a><span aria-hidden="true">/</span><span aria-current="page">Contact</span></nav>
    <span class="eyebrow">Project Enquiries</span>
    <h1>Contact Realjet</h1>
    <p>Tell us what you need to manufacture, the project requirements you already know, and where the project will be delivered.</p>
  </div>
</header>

<section class="contact-section">
  <div class="container contact-grid">
    <aside class="contact-details" aria-labelledby="company-details-title">
      <span class="eyebrow">Company Details</span>
      <h2 id="company-details-title">Start a Direct Conversation</h2>
      <p>Contact Realjet about a machinery component manufacturing requirement or a production-line project for precast concrete components.</p>
      <dl class="contact-list">
        <div><dt>Company</dt><dd>{{ site.legalName }}</dd></div>
        <div><dt>Registered Address</dt><dd>{{ site.address }}</dd></div>
        <div><dt>Email</dt><dd><a href="mailto:{{ site.email }}">{{ site.email }}</a></dd></div>
      </dl>
    </aside>

    <div class="contact-form-card">
      <div data-contact-form-shell>
        <span class="eyebrow">Project Details</span>
        <h2>Send an Enquiry</h2>
        <p class="form-intro">Company, contact name and business email are required. Add any available project details below.</p>
        <form name="universal-enquiry" method="POST" data-contact-form>
          <input type="hidden" name="form-name" value="universal-enquiry" />
          <p class="honeypot"><label>Do not fill this field <input name="bot-field" /></label></p>
          <fieldset>
            <div class="form-grid">
              <label><span>Company *</span><input name="company" type="text" autocomplete="organization" placeholder="Company name" required /></label>
              <label><span>Contact Name *</span><input name="contact_name" type="text" autocomplete="name" placeholder="Your name" required /></label>
              <label><span>Country / Region</span><input name="country" type="text" autocomplete="country-name" placeholder="Project location" /></label>
              <label><span>Business Email *</span><input name="email" type="email" autocomplete="email" placeholder="name@company.com" required /></label>
              <label class="form-span"><span>Enquiry Type *</span><select name="inquiry_topic" required>
                <option value="General Project Enquiry">General Project Enquiry</option>
                <option value="Custom Machinery Component Manufacturing">Custom Machinery Component Manufacturing</option>
                <option value="Precast Concrete Component Production Line">Precast Concrete Component Production Line</option>
                <option value="Precast Concrete Moulds and Formwork">Precast Concrete Moulds and Formwork</option>
              </select></label>
              <label class="form-span"><span>Project Details</span><textarea name="project_details" rows="5" placeholder="Briefly describe the product or component type, quantity, target output or schedule, site conditions, and current project stage. Leave unknown items blank."></textarea></label>
              <label class="privacy-field form-span"><input type="checkbox" name="privacy_acknowledgement" value="Privacy policy acknowledged" required /><span>I have read the <a href="/marketing/privacy/en/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Privacy Policy</a> and understand that Realjet will use my information to respond to this enquiry.</span></label>
            </div>
            <p class="form-error" role="alert" data-contact-error hidden>Submission failed. Please check your connection and try again, or email Realjet directly.</p>
            <button class="button button-dark contact-submit" type="submit" data-contact-submit>Submit Project Details <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></button>
          </fieldset>
        </form>
      </div>
      <div class="contact-success" data-contact-success hidden tabindex="-1">
        <span class="success-mark" aria-hidden="true">✓</span>
        <h2>Your Project Enquiry Has Been Submitted</h2>
        <p>Thank you. A Realjet specialist will contact you using the details provided.</p>
        <a class="button button-dark" href="/">Return to Realjet</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
